    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <div class='je_rdata_container je_html' style='text-align:start'><div class='je_preview'><div class="ewa-rteLine" style="color:#242424; cursor:text; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;,&quot;Mongolian Baiti&quot;,&quot;Microsoft Yi Baiti&quot;,&quot;Javanese Text&quot;,&quot;Yu Gothic&quot;; font-size:14.6667px; height:auto; overflow:hidden; padding-right:10px; text-align:left; text-decoration-thickness:initial; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="color:#000000; display:inline; float:none; text-decoration-thickness:initial">GET /productOffering - display a list of sellable product offerings from&nbsp;</span><b style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Oxygen,Ubuntu,&quot;Fira Sans&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px">CatalogONE </b><b style="-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Oxygen,Ubuntu,&quot;Fira Sans&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px">by filter criteria</b></div>

<div class="ewa-rteLine" style="color:#242424; cursor:text; font-family:&quot;Aptos Narrow&quot;,Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;,&quot;Mongolian Baiti&quot;,&quot;Microsoft Yi Baiti&quot;,&quot;Javanese Text&quot;,&quot;Yu Gothic&quot;; font-size:14.6667px; height:auto; overflow:hidden; padding-right:10px; text-align:left; text-decoration-thickness:initial; white-space:pre-wrap">&nbsp;</div>

<div class="ewa-rteLine" style="cursor:text; height:auto; overflow:hidden; padding-right:10px; text-align:left; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-wrap-mode:wrap"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="background-color:#ffffff">This feature focus on anonymous and check the following use cases:</span></span></div>

<ul style="margin-bottom:1em; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-top:0px; text-align:left; text-decoration-thickness:initial">
	<li style="margin: 10px 0px 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;"><span style="color:#000000"><span><b>By Category</b> -&nbsp;</span></span><span style="color:#000000; display:inline; float:none; text-align:left; text-decoration-thickness:initial">Fetches all product offerings within a specific category name. such as </span><b><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="color:#a02b93">Payment&nbsp;Bundles.</span></span></span></b></li>
	<li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="color:#000000"><b>By Relation Role</b><span>&nbsp;</span>– Retrieves product offerings based on their business type, such as </span><b><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="color:#a02b93">Payment Account Bundle.</span></span></span></b></li>
	<li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>By Filter Criteria</b> -&nbsp;<span style="color:#000000">Retrieves product offerings based on </span>one of the characteristic defined as filterable in C1.</li>
	<li style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>By Product Offering Name</b> - search product offering by name. such as&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Aptos,sans-serif"><span style="color:#a02b93">Payment.</span></span></span></b></li>
</ul>

